# X03 (qemu-virt, ramfb 1920x1080) -- Desk -> Desktop info... on both boards; the box's Machine row.
# Same geometry as measurement-2026-09-24-desk01-desk02/method/desk-desk01.actions:
#   menu title Desk at x 16..64, y 0..18; drop-down entry 0
#   ("  Desktop info... ") at y 19..35.
# The pointer is parked bottom-right (parkbr) before each screendump.
200 parkbr 1920 1080
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 40 8
1800 mark B_DESK_OPEN
2100 move 60 27
2300 down
2303 up
2600 parkbr 1920 1080
3000 mark C_ABOUT
